            "zOrder": "charaBack"
          }
        ],
        "nameNarration": "彩羽",
        "narration": "可在这里，忧也在，@三日月庄的大家也都在，@所有人都幸福地活着，没有任何不安。"
      },
      {
        "narration": "在这里，没有任何值得害怕的东西。"
      },
      {
        "autoTurnLast": 0.1,
        "narrationEffect": "out"
      },
      {
        "autoTurnLast": 0.8,
        "item": [
          {
            "path": "resource/scenario/img/31501_iroha_anime_ver_story/episode16_1.jpg",
            "visible": "hide"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "nameNarration": "彩羽",
        "narration": "[flashEffect:flashWhite2][se:4050_landing_jump]为了把失去大家的@可怕噩梦彻底吹散，@我为自己创造了一个幸福的世界。",
        "narrationAnchor": "bottom",
        "narrationCoverOpacity": 110,
        "narrationEffect": "in",
        "narrationFontSize": 30,
        "narrationLineMargin": 10,
        "narrationLineSpace": 20
      },
      {
        "narration": "即使沉浸在那个梦里，我内心的某处@仍然察觉到，@这个世界并不是真实的。"
      },
      {
        "narration": "我明明已经察觉，却一直假装不知道。"
      },
      {
        "bgm": "stop",
        "narration": "……可是，八千代小姐的声音唤醒了我。@让我明白，不能再这样下去。"
      },
      {
        "autoTurnLast": 0.1,
        "narrationEffect": "out"
      },
      {
        "bgm": "bgm04_movie44",
        "item": [
          {
            "path": "resource/scenario/img/31501_iroha_anime_ver_story/episode16_6.jpg",
            "posX": 0,
            "posY": 0,
            "visible": "appear",
            "zOrder": "charaBack"
          }
        ],
        "nameNarration": "彩羽",
        "narration": "我明明是想去救八千代小姐，@结果却又一次被她救了。",
        "narrationAnchor": "bottom",
        "narrationCoverOpacity": 110,
        "narrationEffect": "in",
        "narrationFontSize": 30,
        "narrationLineMargin": 35,
        "narrationLineSpace": 20
      },
      {
        "narration": "我也终于意识到，自己让八千代小姐担心了多少，@又让她承受了多少痛苦。"
      },
      {
        "narration": "然后，我下定了决心。"
      },
      {
        "narration": "我要找到忧，@也要把三日月庄的大家带回来，@亲手抓住属于我们的幸福。"
      },
      {
        "narration": "只要心里还有珍惜大家的这份感情，@我就没有什么好怕的。"
      },
      {
        "narration": "因为失去大家，才是可怕得多的事。"
      },
      {
        "autoTurnLast": 0.1,
        "narrationEffect": "out"
      },
      {
        "autoTurnLast": 0.8,
